WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.170
Captain's log. Stardate, National Donut Day.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.800
We're under attack from a ship made of solid fire.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.010
All weapons simply pass through and
come out the other end.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:17.800
Like that ball bearing I once mistook for a mint.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:18.610
Oh.

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:25.000
It's a conundrum, Kif. Pray, fetch my travel
tub. I do my best thinking in the shower.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:31.540
Yeah. Ba ba ba ba ba ba ba bum ba bum ba bum
bum bum.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.930
Could you at least close the curtain, sir?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.590
Certainly.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.080
Lieutenant Croaker!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.790
You expect me to think without a loofah?
Where's my loofah?

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:44.530
What loofah?

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:44.540
You!

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.820
You're the loofah.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.950
Oh, well, will you be quiet?

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:55.810
I'm trying to think.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:55.820
Aha!

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:57.480
Water!

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.490
Fire's mortal enemy.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.870
Lieutenant, fire water.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:12.790
What the-

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:14.530
Who used up all the water?

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.580
Your shower depleted the ship's three year
supply, sir.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:25.520
Well, no worries. I can end this battle with
two words.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.810
We surrender.

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:31.070
Sign this certificate of defeat so I can show
my mom.

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.060
Kif, my desk.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:42.230
I'll just put the old Zapp Hancock on it. Big
confident dot on the 'I'.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.800
Ooh! Ooh!

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.760
Oh, you're juicier than I thought, Kif.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:52.020
Oo.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:57.240
Oo oo oo.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:01:59.340
I have had it!

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:04.770
I'm through putting up with your... crap! I'm
filing a formal complaint.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.660
It's pronounced compliment.

